LangAlpha
https://github.com/ginlix-ai/LangAlpha
Commit e102a7838225157f7b3beca3fc274b26be852154
License: Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright 2025 Ginlix AI

No LangAlpha code is included in this repository.
scripts/agent-desk/pitch.ts adapts ideas of two LangAlpha skills: the
readiness posture ladder of plugins/langalpha_research/skills/
research-conventions/SKILL.md and the scenario tree, exit levels and
monitoring steps of plugins/langalpha_research/skills/trade-pitch/SKILL.md.

Changes: structure only. Short terms of art (posture names) are kept; no code
or passages are copied. The skills are instructions for a language model; the
Vertex file is a deterministic TypeScript function over the paper agent
desk's own results and the accepted fundamentals dataset. The posture rules
are Vertex's own ordered table, and LangAlpha's top posture (decision-grade)
is not used; no probability, order, size or instrument is produced; no model,
network, sandbox or broker connector is used. LangAlpha has no NOTICE file at
this commit.
