TradingView trend indicators (Trend Trio, card vertex-trend-trio)
Checked 2026-11-14. No Pine Script source code is included in this repository.
The formulas below are re-implemented from their public descriptions in
services/research/indicators/trend.py, packages/shared/src/indicators/trend.ts,
packages/scripting/src/ta.ts and the script templates in
packages/scripting/src/templates.ts.

- SuperTrend: TradingView built-in ta.supertrend, Pine Script reference manual,
  https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-reference/v6/#fun_ta.supertrend
  (a built-in function; the manual states no licence for its formula)
- Ultimate MA: ChrisMoody, CM_Ultimate_MA_MTF_V2,
  https://www.tradingview.com/script/8KVcQiJM-CM-Ultimate-MA-MTF-V2/
  (no licence header; published as open source under TradingView House Rules)
- AlphaTrend: KivancOzbilgic, AlphaTrend,
  https://www.tradingview.com/script/o50NYLAZ-AlphaTrend/
  (the script states Mozilla Public License 2.0)
- Chandelier Exit: the formula of Chuck LeBeau (highest high minus a multiple
  of the average true range; StockCharts ChartSchool) in the ratcheting form of
  everget, Chandelier Exit [everget],
  https://www.tradingview.com/script/AqXxNS7j-Chandelier-Exit-everget/
  (the script states GNU GPL 3.0; only the formula is used)
- Slingshot: ChrisMoody, CM Sling Shot System (EMA 38 against EMA 62),
  https://www.tradingview.com/script/GE7tSQK1-CM-Sling-Shot-System/
  (no licence header; published as open source under TradingView House Rules)
